ling\n- Use intelligent queuing for requests\n- Provide clear rate limit status information\n- Implement request prioritization\n\n## Error Handling Guidelines\n1. Always log detailed error information\n2. Provide meaningful error messages\n3. Implement comprehensive error tracking\n4. Design for graceful error recovery\n5. Maintain system stability during error conditions\n\n## Monitoring and Improvement\n- Regularly analyze error logs\n- Track error frequency and impact\n- Continuously refine error handling strategies\n- Implement automated error reporting'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_014PZ1PfyMSvjurjxEhmwN81', 'content': '{"success": true, "message": "File written successfully to /Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/executive_director_error_handling.md", "backup_path": null, "was_overwrite": false}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01K9a4WTHjnVMuA3jdw6r4zx', 'name': 'project_tracking', 'input': {'action': 'add_note', 'project_id': '97e0e003', 'category': 'milestone', 'note': 'Completed initial error handling documentation for Executive Director agent'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01K9a4WTHjnVMuA3jdw6r4zx', 'content': '{"success": true, "message": "Added note to project"}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01T3tGvGme9ppDmnfe6toacd', 'name': 'git_commit', 'input': {'message': 'Add error handling guidelines for Executive Director agent', 'files': ['/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/executive_director_error_handling.md']}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01T3tGvGme9ppDmnfe6toacd', 'content': '{"success": true, "message": "No changes to commit", "commit_hash": null}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': '{\n    "task_status": "completed",\n    "projec