andling mechanisms for BadRequestError and CircuitBreakerOpenError', 'assigned_to': 'Unit Test Lead'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01TmdS6HabDCwH6eDz6jAYMS', 'content': '{"success": true, "task_id": "9a004357", "message": "Added task: Implement code-level error handling mechanisms for BadRequestError and CircuitBreakerOpenError"}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01RBRGCQQJCe2RMcrmsoJ8MZ', 'name': 'project_tracking', 'input': {'action': 'add_note', 'project_id': '3ba10950', 'category': 'milestone', 'note': 'Proceeding with implementation of error handling code to complement previously created guidelines'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01RBRGCQQJCe2RMcrmsoJ8MZ', 'content': '{"success": true, "message": "Added note to project"}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01FqsMsxGtKwM7SuE53xB9Jt', 'name': 'write_file', 'input': {'file_path': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/error_handler.py', 'content': 'import logging\nimport time\nfrom typing import Callable, Any\nfrom functools import wraps\n\nclass ErrorHandler:\n    """Centralized error handling and recovery mechanism"""\n    \n    @staticmethod\n    def retry(max_attempts: int = 3, backoff_in_seconds: float = 1.0):\n        """\n        Decorator for implementing retry mechanism with exponential backoff\n        \n        :param max_attempts: Maximum number of retry attempts\n        :param backoff_in_seconds: Initial delay between retries\n        """\n        def decorator(func: Callable):\n            @wraps(func)\n            def wrapper(*args, **kwargs):\n                attempts = 0\n                current_backoff = backoff_in_seconds\n                \n                while attempts < max_attempts:\n                    try:\n                        return func(*args, **kwargs)\n           